# JOURNEY · the Geiger Coil, the sense that reads radiation: hot is rads above its threshold, and a
# plain Fishtank has none. A coiled fish hearing hot is therefore a clean-water lamp: it denies a zero.
# Its panel walks by count: listens, drives, threshold, rads, hot, mutated.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/grow-a-matrixtank.play
include scenes/buy-at-the-bench.play "Geiger Coil" Senses
include scenes/buy-at-the-bench.play "Inverter Coil" Fabric
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish geiger
include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish clean

run /consume geiger coil
key enter
absent to the botfishes
run /consume inverter coil
key down
key enter
absent to the botfishes

run /program "Geiger"
key down 4
expect hot[1]
type hot
snap the coil's hot flag is wired to hot
key enter
absent listens

run /program "Clean"
type hot
key down
type clean
key enter

tick 3
run /circuit
expect ●  Clean
snap the water is cold, so the coiled fish that denies hot is lit
key esc
absent Circuit#
